  "title": "Sister Beth&#39;s Carrot Cake",
  "description": "This carrot cake combines carrots, pineapple, and cinnamon with shredded coconut and walnuts for a perfectly delicious cake. Homemade cream cheese frosting provides a smoothness with every bite.",
  "authors": [
